.TH VOLBOT 1 "August 2026" "v3.0" "Solana Volume Bot"
.SH NAME
volbot \- Interactive Solana DEX trading, volume, and liquidity bot
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B volbot
[\fI--demo\fR|\fB--wallet\fR|\fB--tip\fR \fILAMPORTS\fR \fISEED\fR|\fB--test\fR|\fB--web\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B volbot
is a self-contained, auditable Solana DEX trading bot with an interactive
menu-driven CLI. It supports wallet management, Jupiter API trading,
backtesting, bundle bot coordination (Jito MEV), multi-DEX liquidity provision,
and wash trading simulation across 6 DEXes (Pump.fun, Raydium, Orca,
Meteora, Openbook, Jupiter).

The bot uses Python 3 for orchestration and Node.js (@noble/curves) for
cryptographic operations only. All wallet data is stored locally with no
external telemetry, analytics, or webhooks.

A web visualization dashboard is available via the --web flag (requires Flask in
Python 3.13 Termux environment). The dashboard provides live-updating charts,
wash trading simulation, and trending pair displays.

.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B volbot (no args)
Start the interactive menu system with 13 menu sections.
.TP
.B volbot --demo
Run bot.py demo mode: generates wallets, derives sub-wallets,
gets Jupiter quotes, and prints a cost estimate (~$18). No real trades.
.TP
.B volbot --wallet
Generate a new Solana keypair and print the seed and pubkey as JSON.
.TP
.B volbot --tip LAMPORTS SEED
Build a Jito tip transfer transaction using the given seed.
Outputs a signed transaction in base64 format.
.TP
.B volbot --test
Run the verification suite: checks syntax of all 10 Python files
and confirms all modules import correctly.
.TP
.B volbot --web
Start the web visualization server (requires Python 3.13 with Flask).
Serves a browser dashboard with live price charts, wash trading simulation,
trending pairs, and DEX profiles. Visit http://localhost:8765 in any browser.

.SH MENU SECTIONS
.TP
1. Wallet Management
Generate new wallets, derive sub-wallets via HMAC-SHA512,
check SOL/token balances, validate seed format. All keys
stored locally — no external callbacks.
.TP
2. Trading Engine
Jupiter API v6 swap quotes (SOL/USDC/tokens), real-time
price feeds via Jupiter Price API v3, trending pair
discovery via DexScreener, batch quotes, network condition
estimation (priority fees), Pump.fun bonding curve
quotes, and Jito MEV tip amounts.
.TP
3. Trading Strategies
Backtest and compare strategies: Dip Buy, Trailing Stop, Mean Reversion,
Momentum, DCA, Volume Spike, Bollinger Squeeze, VWAP Deviation, Fibonacci.
Compare strategies with metrics: total return, Sharpe,
max drawdown, win rate, profit factor, trade count.
Includes Strategy Configuration Wizard (Menu 3 > 5) and recommended
starting values for beginners.
.TP
4. Bundle Bot (Jito MEV)
Coordinate multi-wallet trading as atomic bundles.
Supports 4 money tiers (MICRO $5, SMALL $8, MEDIUM $15, LARGE $20).
Pump.fun modes: buy_and_sell, volume_spam, dump_impact.
.TP
5. On-Chain Monitoring
Check RPC health (latency, slot, block time), query token accounts,
run rug pull risk detection, scan DEX pool state.
.TP
6. Portfolio Management
Track wallet balances, calculate total portfolio value in USD,
monitor individual token holdings with real-time pricing.
.TP
7. Token Discovery
Scan DexScreener for trending pairs (search by symbol),
find new token mints created recently, check token metadata,
browse Pump.fun trending, view recent liquidity pool activity,
get top coins by volume (10-50 results), and view live ASCII
price charts for any token.
.TP
8. Liquidity and Wash Trading
Browse 6 DEXes (Pump.fun, Raydium, Orca, Meteora, Openbook, Jupiter). Discover liquidity pools, create
automated liquidity provision strategies for different DEX types,
add/remove liquidity with range orders, check pool depth and slippage,
estimate fees and APR, set up wash trading with multiple wallets,
estimate costs, list 5 wash trading strategies, and run interactive
demo with live ASCII price charts.
.TP
9. Advanced Tools
Build custom swap transactions with Jito tips, fetch batch swap quotes,
calculate optimal trading amounts, analyze price impact, and configure
strategy parameters via the wizard.
.TP
10. Settings
Configure RPC endpoint (mainnet/devnet), money tier (MICRO/SMALL/MEDIUM/LARGE),
slippage tolerance, and wallet seed for trading operations.
.TP
11. Environment (.env Editor)
Interactive editor for .env file with 10 configurable variables
(PRIVATE_KEY, TOKEN_MINT, RPC_ENDPOINT, SLIPPAGE_BPS, JITO_RPC, etc.)
Supports creating from template, resetting defaults, and loading/saving
from .env file. Auto-loads .env on startup.
.TP
12. Portfolio Manager
Track multiple wallets with balance refresh (SOL + SPL tokens),
view detailed token holdings, export portfolio data as JSON/CSV,
and manage wallet list (add/remove). Wallet seeds can be saved locally.
.TP
13. API Resources and Guides
Browse documentation links and free-tier API resources for
Pump.fun, Jito, Jupiter, DexScreener, Birdeye, Allora, Alchemy,
and QuickNode. No payment required for basic operation.

