.TP
.I config.py
Money tiers, bundle configs, strategy combos (282 lines).
.TP
.I sign_sender.js
Transaction signing with ed25519 (@noble/curves) (373 lines).
.TP
.I wallet_utils.js
Key generation and HMAC-SHA512 sub-wallet derivation (101 lines).
.TP
.I web_viz.py
Web visualization server using Flask + Chart.js (26KB).
Serves live dashboards with interactive price charts, wash trading simulation,
