Environment configuration template (42 lines).

.SH MONEY TIERS
.TP
MICRO ($5)
3 wallets, 0.01 SOL/wallet, 3 cycles. For testing.
.TP
SMALL ($8)
4 wallets, 0.01 SOL/wallet, 4 cycles. For light volume.
.TP
MEDIUM ($15)
5 wallets, 0.015 SOL/wallet, 6 cycles. For moderate volume.
.TP
LARGE ($20)
8 wallets, 0.015 SOL/wallet, 8 cycles. Maximum within budget.

.SH STRATEGIES
.TP
Dip Buy
Buys when price drops below SMA by threshold (default 3 percent).
.TP
Trailing Stop
Trails highest price since entry; sells when price drops 5 percent from peak.
.TP
Mean Reversion
Uses RSI: buys when RSI below 30, sells when RSI above 70.
.TP
Momentum
Buys on EMA crossover (fast EMA crosses above slow EMA).
.TP
DCA
Dollar-cost averaging with fixed intervals.
.TP
Volume Spike
Detects sudden volume increases above moving average threshold.
.TP
Bollinger Squeeze
Buys when BB width contracts below threshold, sells on expansion.
.TP
VWAP Deviation
Trades based on price deviation from VWAP.
.TP
Fibonacci Retracement
Uses Fibonacci levels for entry and exit points.

.SH WALLET DERIVATION
Sub-wallets are derived deterministically using HMAC-SHA512 with
index prefixes (vol_0 through vol_N). Each sub-wallet gets
its own ed25519 keypair from the main seed.

Keys are saved locally only. No external callbacks.

.SH WASH TRADING STRATEGIES
.TP
Round Robin
Wallets trade sequentially in a circle (A to B to C to A).
.TP
Ping Pong
Two wallets trade back and forth rapidly.
.TP
Ring Trading
All wallets participate in a circular trade simultaneously.
.TP
Whale Mimicry
Large trade followed by smaller confirming trades.
.TP
Market Maker
Post both bids and asks across multiple wallets.

.SH SECURITY
.TP
No external calls
All operations are local. No telemetry, analytics, or webhooks.
.TP
No eval/atob
Source code scanned for dangerous patterns (eval, atob, etc.).
.TP
Local-only storage
All wallet seeds and keys stored in local files only.

.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
PYTHONPATH
Set to bot directory for module imports by start-bot.sh.
.TP
PYTHONUNBUFFERED
Set to 1 for real-time output flushing.
.TP
.env FILE
Configuration file with these variables:

.TS
tab(|);
l | l | l
< | < | <
<
PRIVATE_KEY | Main wallet private key (base58) | Optional
TOKEN_MINT | Token to trade (SOL, USDC, BONK, or mint address) | Optional
RPC_ENDPOINT | Solana RPC URL | Optional (defaults to mainnet-beta)
SLIPPAGE_BPS | Slippage tolerance in basis points | Optional (defaults to 300)
JITO_RPC | Jito RPC endpoint for MEV bundles | Optional
PUMPFUN_API_KEY | Pump.fun API key | Optional (not required for basic use)
DEXSCREENER_API | DexScreener API key | Optional (not required for basic use)
BIRDEYE_API_KEY | Birdeye API key | Optional (not required for basic use)
JUPITER_API_KEY | Jupiter API key | Optional (not required for basic use)
LOG_LEVEL | Logging level | Optional (defaults to INFO)
.TE

