.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Run full interactive CLI:
.B volbot
.TP
Quick demo:
.B volbot --demo
.TP
Generate a wallet:
.B volbot --wallet
.TP
Build a tip transfer:
.B volbot --tip 50000 <your_seed_b58>
.TP
Run verification:
.B volbot --test
.TP
Start web dashboard:
.B volbot --web
Then open http://localhost:8765 in your browser.
.TP
Run backtest manually:
.B python3 -c "from backtest import *; prices = generate_trending_data(150, seed=42); print(run_strategy_comparison(prices, [(DipBuy, DipBuyStrategy, {}), (TrailingStop, TrailingStopStrategy, {})]))"
.TP
Run wash trading demo:
.B python3 -c "from cli import _run_wash_trading_demo; cli.clear_screen = lambda: None; cli._run_wash_trading_demo()"
.TP
Check token safety:
.B python3 safety_check.py TOKEN_MINT
Or use Menu 7 > 8 (Token Safety Check).
.TP
Start Telegram bot:
.B python3 telegram_bot.py
Requires TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN in .env. Get token from @BotFather.
Commands: /start, /buy, /sell, /snipe, /check (safety), /presets, /owl

.SH BEGINNER TIPS
.TP
Getting started
Always run 'volbot --test' first to verify your environment.
.TP
Wallet safety
Generate a wallet with 'volbot --wallet' or Menu 1. Store the seed offline.
.TP
Risk-free practice
Use Menu 3 > Backtest to test strategies against historical data before trading.
.TP
Wash trading demo
Run the demo via Menu 8 > D to see live price charts and wallet interactions.
.TP
Dashboard
Run 'volbot --web' and open your browser for interactive charts with live updates.
.TP
Finding coins
Use Menu 7 > Top Coins by Volume to discover trending tokens with sufficient liquidity.
.TP
API keys
Menu 13 lists free-tier API resources. No payment is required to start.
.TP
Budget control
MICRO ($5) tier for testing, SMALL ($8) for beginners, MEDIUM ($15) for moderate use.
.TP
Before trading
Always check volbot --test, configure RPC in Menu 10, and verify wallet in Menu 1.
.TP
Safety first
Before buying any token, run Menu 7 > 8 (Token Safety Check) or /check TOKEN in Telegram.

